        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "At each of our Mexican airports, we earn revenues from charging access fees to various third-party providers of complementary services, including luggage check-in, sorting and handling, aircraft servicing at our gates, aircraft cleaning, cargo handling, aircraft catering services and assistance with passenger boarding and deplaning.",
        "start_character": 37707,
        "end_character": 38041
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-044448",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-044448-8007144df5904bdd",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-044448",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "ITA provides us assistance in various areas, including strategic planning, financial analysis and control, development of our commercial activities, preparation of marketing studies focusing on increasing passenger traffic volume at our airports, political and regulatory issues, assistance with the preparation of the master development plans that we are required to submit to the Ministry of Infrastructure, Communications and Transportation with respect to each of our airports, construction programming, exploring and analyzing new business opportunities, and the improvement of our airport operations.",
        "start_character": 3007,
        "end_character": 3613
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-044448",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-044448-8007144df5904bdd",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-044448",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Pursuant to Airplan’s concession agreement and Aerocivil regulations, we are required to provide (without additional charge) firefighting and rescue services at our airports.",
        "start_character": 103806,
        "end_character": 103980
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-044448",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-044448-8007144df5904bdd",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-044448",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Under the Mexican Airport Law, we are required to provide complementary services at each of our Mexican airports if there is no third party providing such services.",
        "start_character": 39249,
        "end_character": 39413
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-044448",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-044448-8007144df5904bdd",
