        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In April 2006, we obtained a license to develop cargo facilities at Cancún Airport, which are currently being operated by our subsidiary Caribbean Logistics, S.A.",
        "start_character": 58980,
        "end_character": 59142
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-044448",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-044448-8007144df5904bdd",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-044448",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Other states have established local taxes on the emission of greenhouse gasses (such as Colima, Mexico City, Puebla, San Luis Potosi), and it is possible that other states where we operate airports (Quintana Roo, Oaxaca, Veracruz, Tabasco and Chiapas) will impose new environmental taxes, resulting in higher operation costs that may affect our financial condition.",
