        "filing_date": "2026-04-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Our subsidiary Airplan, of which we own 100.0% of the capital stock, holds a concession to administer, operate, develop and maintain six airports in Colombia.",
