        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The Mexican National Assets Law, published in the Mexican Official Gazette on May 20, 2004, among other items, establishes regulations relating to concessions on real property held in the public domain, including the airports that we operate.",
